 annotation on both overloads and the implementation.\n  - The body now wraps a `str` or `os.PathLike` in a one-item tuple.\n  - The docstring has the new sentence and a `versionchanged:: 8.5.0` entry.\n- **`_termui_impl.py`:** I changed only the `edit_files` annotation. I didn't change the body, because `subprocess.Popen` accepts path objects in its args list.\n- **`CHANGES.md`:** I added the entry at the end of the 8.5.0 list. That list is headed `## Version 8.5.0` rather than `Unreleased`, which is where the spec said to put it.\n\nI didn't run the typing check, `tests/typing/typing_edit.py`, since the spec's required command only covers `tests/test_termui.py`.", "ttft_ms": 1984, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 30338, "uuid": "612748cd-1182-4abb-9f30-62f7eebde00c", "ttft_stream_ms": 1539, "time_to_request_ms": 55, "first_content_frame_ms": 1539, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
